# Production-Ready Spring Cloud Gateway with Keycloak JWT Security

Below is a **complete, production-ready** Spring Cloud Gateway application. It acts as an **OAuth2 Resource Server** (validates JWTs from Keycloak), supports **role-based authorization**, **rate limiting**, **circuit breakers**, **global filters**, **CORS**, **custom error handling**, and more.

